    "anchor": "cumulative-and-or-conditions",
    "summary": "Some cards follow a normal scoring condition with labelled ones:\n\n- ‘Cumulative’: meeting it pays its own VP plus the normal condition's VP.\n- ‘Or’: only one condition pays, either the normal one or one alternative.",
